+# MathPivot Environment Setup
+
+Complete list of environment variables and third-party service setup needed to run MathPivot in production.
+
+## Where to set environment variables
+
+**Vercel Dashboard** → Your project → **Settings** → **Environment Variables**
+
+Add each variable for the environments you need: **Production**, **Preview**, and/or **Development**.
+
+After adding, **redeploy** the site (Deployments → latest → ⋯ → Redeploy) for changes to take effect.
+
+---
+
+## Required — Site does not work without these
+
+### Supabase (Database + Auth)
+
+| Variable | Where to get it | Notes |
+|---|---|---|
+| `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL` | Supabase Dashboard → Project Settings → API → Project URL | Public — safe to expose |
+| `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY` | Supabase Dashboard → Project Settings → API → `anon` `public` key | Public — safe to expose |
+| `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` | Supabase Dashboard → Project Settings → API → `service_role` `secret` key | **NEVER expose to client.** Used by admin/API routes only. |
+
+### App URL
+
+| Variable | Value | Notes |
+|---|---|---|
+| `NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL` | `https://mathpivot.com` (production) or your Vercel preview URL | Used for redirect URLs, email links, etc. |
+
+---
+
+## Highly Recommended — Site works partially without these
+
+### Resend (Transactional Email)
+
+Sends: diagnostic results, session reminders, purchase confirmations, weekly digests, partnership inquiry notifications.
+
+| Variable | Where to get it | Notes |
+|---|---|---|
+| `RESEND_API_KEY` | Resend Dashboard → API Keys → Create with **Sending access** | Starts with `re_` |
+| `EMAIL_FROM` | `MathPivot <noreply@mathpivot.com>` | Must be from a domain verified in Resend |
+
+**Setup steps:**
+1. Sign up at resend.com
+2. Verify `mathpivot.com` domain (add DNS records they provide)
+3. Create API key with **Sending access** (not Full access)
+4. Add both env vars above and redeploy
+
+Without this: emails silently fail. Users still see success messages, but no email arrives.
+
+---
+
+## Optional but valuable
+
+### Stripe (Payments)
+
+Powers: summer clinic checkout, coaching subscriptions, coach payouts (future).
+
+| Variable | Where to get it | Notes |
+|---|---|---|
+| `STRIPE_SECRET_KEY` | Stripe Dashboard → Developers → API Keys → **Secret key** | `sk_test_...` for testing, `sk_live_...` for production |
+| `NEXT_PUBLIC_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY` | Stripe Dashboard → Developers → API Keys → **Publishable key** | `pk_test_...` for testing, `pk_live_...` for production |
+| `STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET` | Stripe Dashboard → Developers → Webhooks → your endpoint → **Signing secret** | `whsec_...` |
+
+**Webhook setup:**
+1. Stripe Dashboard → Developers → Webhooks → Add endpoint
+2. Endpoint URL: `https://mathpivot.com/api/stripe/webhook`
+3. Events to send: `checkout.session.completed`, `checkout.session.expired`, `payment_intent.payment_failed`
+4. Copy the signing secret → set as `STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET`
+
+Without this: purchase pages show but "Buy" button fails. Fine for pre-launch testing.
+
+### Anthropic (AI Math Tutor)
+
+Powers: `/student/ai-tutor` chat.
+
+| Variable | Where to get it |
+|---|---|
+| `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` | console.anthropic.com → API Keys |
+
+Without this: AI Tutor page loads but responses fail with an error message.
+
+### Sentry (Error Monitoring)
+
+Catches JavaScript errors + server exceptions in production.
+
+| Variable | Where to get it |
+|---|---|
+| `NEXT_PUBLIC_SENTRY_DSN` | sentry.io → Your project → Settings → Client Keys (DSN) |
+| `SENTRY_AUTH_TOKEN` | sentry.io → Settings → Auth Tokens (for source map uploads) |
+
+Without this: no crash reports; you find bugs when users complain.
+
+### Google Integrations (Calendar / Classroom)
+
+Powers: coach calendar sync, classroom roster imports.
+
+| Variable | Where to get it |
+|---|---|
+| `GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID` | Google Cloud Console → Credentials → OAuth 2.0 Client ID |
+| `GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET` | Same location as client ID |
+
+**Redirect URI to register:** `https://mathpivot.com/api/integrations/google/callback`
+
+Without this: Google Calendar / Classroom features on `/settings/integrations` don't work. Core coaching still functions.
+
+---
+
+## Vercel Live Preview Toolbar
+
+Already handled in `next.config.ts` CSP allowlist — no env var needed.
